# The most CPU instructions each hot path's in-process work may execute,
# counted by callgrind (scripts/perf/instructions.sh, #2249): one line per
# path, as `<path> <ceiling>`. A ceiling is lowered in a normal change and
# raised only with its cause stated in the pull request; `report` measures a
# path without judging it.
fhir_to_openehr report
openehr_to_fhir report
hl7v2_ack report
